title: <span style="color: #FFCC00;">**LVP**</span>が[? if in_popular_front_prussia and not in_popular_front:プロイセンの?]人民戦線政権から離脱！
subtitle: 予想どおりだ。
new-page: true
on-arrival: lvp_relation -= 6; lvp_right += 3 {! 
if (Q.lvp_formed) {
    Q.popular_front_coalition = parseFloat((Q.spd_r + Q.kpd_r + Q.z_r - Q.bvp_r + Q.sapd_r).toFixed(1));
} else if (Q.liberal_parliament == 0 && Q.bourgeois_parliament_ddp == 0) {
    Q.popular_front_coalition = parseFloat((Q.spd_r + Q.kpd_r + Q.z_r + Q.ddp_r - Q.bvp_r + Q.sapd_r).toFixed(1));
} else if (Q.liberal_parliament == 1 || Q.bourgeois_parliament_ddp == 1) {
    Q.popular_front_coalition = parseFloat((Q.spd_r + Q.kpd_r + Q.z_r - Q.bvp_r + Q.sapd_r).toFixed(1));
}

if (Q.lvp_formed) {
    Q.popular_front_coalition_prussia = parseFloat((Q.spd_r_prussia + Q.kpd_r_prussia + Q.z_r_prussia + Q.sapd_r_prussia).toFixed(1));
} else if (Q.liberal_parliament == 0) {
    Q.popular_front_coalition_prussia = parseFloat((Q.spd_r_prussia + Q.kpd_r_prussia + Q.z_r_prussia + Q.ddp_r_prussia + Q.sapd_r_prussia).toFixed(1));
} else if (Q.liberal_parliament == 1) {
    Q.popular_front_coalition_prussia = parseFloat((Q.spd_r_prussia + Q.kpd_r_prussia + Q.z_r_prussia + Q.sapd_r_prussia).toFixed(1));
}
!}
view-if: ((in_popular_front and ddp_in_popular_front) or (in_popular_front_prussia and ddp_in_popular_front_prussia)) and lvp_formed 
tags: event

= <span style="color: #FFCC00;">**LVP**</span>が人民戦線政権から離脱！

<span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>は自ら解党し、<span style="color: #C0A054;">**DVP**</span>と合流して、はるかに右寄りの政党となった。予想どおり、[? if in_popular_front_prussia and not in_popular_front:プロイセンの?][? if in_popular_front_prussia and in_popular_front:プロイセンと全国の?]現人民戦線政権への支持を撤回した。

[? if in_popular_front: [? if popular_front_coalition >= 50: 幸い、彼らの票がなくても我々は過半数を維持しており、大きな混乱もなく政権から離脱させられる。?][? if popular_front_coalition < 50: 残念ながら、旧<span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>の票は人民戦線の存続に不可欠であり、彼らを失った今、我々の政権は過半数を欠いている。[? if constructive_vonc: ただし、我々が行った憲法改革のおかげで、少数政権として存続することはできる。?]?] ?]

[? if in_popular_front_prussia: [? if popular_front_coalition_prussia >= 50: プロイセンでは幸い、彼らの票がなくても過半数を維持できる。彼らが州政権を離脱しても、我々は[? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">中央党</span>?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?]とともに政権を担い続けられる。?][? if popular_front_coalition_prussia < 50: プロイセンでは旧<span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>の票が人民戦線の存続に不可欠であり、彼らを失った今、我々の州政権は過半数を欠いている。?] ?]

- @popular_front_lives: そうか。
- @collapse: 我々の政権が不信任投票に直面している！
- @collapse_prussia: 我々のプロイセン州政権が不信任投票に直面している！

@popular_front_lives
view-if: ((popular_front_coalition >= 50 or not ddp_in_popular_front or constructive_vonc) and (popular_front_coalition_prussia >= 50 or not ddp_in_popular_front_prussia)) and not (popular_front_coalition >= 50 and popular_front_coalition_prussia < 50 and ddp_in_popular_front_prussia)
on-arrival: ddp_in_popular_front = 0; ddp_in_popular_front_prussia = 0

彼らが[? if in_popular_front and in_popular_front_prussia:全国とプロイセンで?][? if not in_popular_front and in_popular_front_prussia:プロイセンで?]閣僚ポストを持っていた場合、そのポストは[? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">中央党</span>?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?]に移った。

@collapse
view-if: popular_front_coalition < 50 and ddp_in_popular_front and not constructive_vonc
on-arrival: time_to_election = 3; spd_in_government = 0; grand_coalition_collapsed = 1 if in_grand_coalition; in_grand_coalition = 0; in_weimar_coalition = 0; in_popular_front = 0; ddp_in_popular_front = 0; spd_toleration = 0; spd_toleration_right = 0; foreign_minister_party = "DVP"; foreign_minister_party = "LVP" if lvp_formed; interior_minister_party = "Z"; justice_minister_party = "I"; labor_minister_party = "Z"; reichswehr_minister_party = "I"; economic_minister_party = ddp_name; economic_minister_party = "LVP" if lvp_formed; finance_minister_party = "DVP"; finance_minister_party = "LVP" if lvp_formed; agriculture_minister_party = "Z"; labor_minister = "Stegerwald"; interior_minister = "Wirth"; finance_minister = "Moldenhauer"; economic_minister = "Curtius"; justice_minister = "Koch-Weser"; foreign_minister = "Stresemann" if not stresemann_dead; foreign_minister = "Curtius" if stresemann_dead; agriculture_minister = "Dietrich"; reichswehr_minister = "Groener"; coalition_dissent = 0; pro_republic -= 4; old_middle_spd -= 3; new_middle_spd -= 2; workers_spd -= 3 if pro_republic < 50; workers_spd -= 4 if pro_republic < 40; old_middle_nsdap += 4 if pro_republic < 50; new_middle_nsdap += 3 if pro_republic < 50
go-to: let_it_happen_hindenburg if president_ideology != "Left"; let_it_happen_braun if president_ideology == "Left"

@let_it_happen_hindenburg
on-arrival: chancellor = "Brüning"; chancellor_party = "Z"; welfare -= 2; bruning_event_timer = 6 if not bruning_event_seen and year >= 1930
go-to: elections if bruning_event_seen or year < 1930

不信任案は[+ 100 - popular_front_coalition +]％の賛成で可決され、我々の政権は総辞職した。ブルジョワ諸党のみで構成される新内閣の首相にはブリューニングが任命された。彼は直ちに社会福祉支出の大幅削減に着手した。

[? if not bruning_event_seen and year >= 1930: まだ選挙の実施は発表されていないが、ブリューニングは国会の過半数の支持を得ていない可能性が高く、近く発表される公算が大きい。?]

@elections
call: set_next_election_time
go-to: collapse_prussia if (popular_front_coalition_prussia < 50 and ddp_in_popular_front_prussia)

次の選挙は[+ next_election_year +]年[+ next_election_month : month +]に決まった。

@let_it_happen_braun
on-arrival: spd_caretaker = 1
call: set_next_election_time
go-to: collapse_prussia if (popular_front_coalition_prussia < 50 and ddp_in_popular_front_prussia)

不信任案が可決され、我々の政権は総辞職した。[+ chancellor +]首相は暫定政権の長として留任するが、もはや新たな政策を実施する権限はない。

次の選挙は[+ next_election_year +]年[+ next_election_month : month +]に決まった。

@collapse_prussia
view-if: (popular_front_coalition_prussia < 50 and ddp_in_popular_front_prussia) and not (in_popular_front and ddp_in_popular_front and popular_front_coalition < 50 and not constructive_vonc)
on-arrival: was_in_social_catholic_coalition_prussia = 0; was_in_social_liberal_coalition_prussia = 0; was_in_weimar_coalition_prussia = 0; was_in_grand_coalition_prussia = 0; was_in_social_catholic_coalition_prussia = 1 if in_social_catholic_coalition_prussia == 1 or in_minority_social_catholic_coalition_prussia == 1; was_in_social_liberal_coalition_prussia = 1 if in_social_liberal_coalition_prussia == 1 or in_minority_social_liberal_coalition_prussia == 1; was_in_weimar_coalition_prussia = 1 if ((in_weimar_coalition_prussia == 1 or in_minority_weimar_coalition_prussia == 1) or (in_grand_coalition_prussia == 1 and lvp_formed)); was_in_grand_coalition_prussia = 1 if (in_grand_coalition_prussia == 1 or in_minority_grand_coalition_prussia == 1); in_right_coalition_prussia = 0; in_social_catholic_coalition_prussia = 0; in_social_liberal_coalition_prussia = 0; in_weimar_coalition_prussia = 0; in_grand_coalition_prussia = 0; in_minority_grand_coalition_prussia = 0; in_popular_front_prussia = 0; in_left_front_prussia = 0; sapd_toleration_prussia = 0; in_spd_majority_prussia = 0; in_center_right_coalition_prussia = 0; in_far_right_coalition_prussia = 0; in_minority_weimar_coalition_prussia = 0; in_minority_social_catholic_coalition_prussia = 0; in_minority_social_liberal_coalition_prussia = 0; spd_prussia = 0; right_prussia = 0; ddp_in_popular_front_prussia = 0; kpd_goals_seen_prussia = 0; spd_toleration_prussia = 0
call: set_next_election_time_prussia

次のプロイセン州議会選挙は[+ next_election_year_prussia +]年[+ next_election_month_prussia : month +]に決まった。
